        ],
        "translations": [
            {
                "id": 14595,
                "text": "when this virtuous king Sunetre will rise as Buddha in the world",
                "anchorStartIndex": 7,
                "anchorEndIndex": 15
            },
            {
                "id": 14596,
                "text": "then we will be his tireless servants",
                "anchorStartIndex": 15,
                "anchorEndIndex": 20
            },
            {
                "id": 14597,
                "text": "he can somehow be a refuge for our sorrow ",
                "anchorStartIndex": 20,
                "anchorEndIndex": 28
            },
            {
                "id": 14935,
                "text": "Jnanastite says: friend, please bring this in your mind",
                "anchorStartIndex": 28,
                "anchorEndIndex": 35
            },
            {
                "id": 14936,
                "text": "when this virtuous Aranemi by name was king",
                "anchorStartIndex": 35,
                "anchorEndIndex": 42
            },
            {
                "id": 14937,
                "text": "then he did a thing even more wonderful",
                "anchorStartIndex": 42,
                "anchorEndIndex": 50
            },
            {
                "id": 14938,
                "text": "Gunsampade says: O able one!",
                "anchorStartIndex": 50,
                "anchorEndIndex": 53
            },
            {
                "id": 15415,
                "text": "please remember the good activity of that king Araṇemi more carefully!”",
                "anchorStartIndex": 53,
                "anchorEndIndex": 69
            },
            {
                "id": 15424,
                "text": "Jñānasthite says: With upraised minds hear without distraction about this link pertaining to jataka!",
                "anchorStartIndex": 69,
                "anchorEndIndex": 77
            },
            {
                "id": 15444,
                "text": "not long ago this time has passed",
                "anchorStartIndex": 82,
                "anchorEndIndex": 89
            },
            {
                "id": 15447,
                "text": "the king Aranemi is now a human jewel",
                "anchorStartIndex": 89,
                "anchorEndIndex": 94
            },
            {
                "id": 15451,
                "text": "he was in the city of Arunavati",
                "anchorStartIndex": 94,
                "anchorEndIndex": 97
            },
            {
                "id": 15458,
                "text": "he was decorated with ornaments of virtues",
                "anchorStartIndex": 97,
                "anchorEndIndex": 104
            },
            {
                "id": 15465,
                "text": "but now this Aranemi king has risen to the glory pertaining to Buddha",
                "anchorStartIndex": 104,
                "anchorEndIndex": 116
            },
            {
                "id": 15466,
                "text": "following the tune",
                "anchorStartIndex": 80,
                "anchorEndIndex": 82
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": 15572,
        "text": "ñiś ñke\nsū ñi yärke śpālmeṃ ṣai pāramitne āyorṣṣe mā no kᵤlā-ñ palsko\nkrᵤi ñke tetekā śänmyeṃ yaṣṣūcañ\nlareṃ śauly ñi yaṣyeṃträ sāw ñi wrotstsa katkauña mā cakravārtñe\nlāntsa weṣṣäṃ saswa srukalyñemeṃ taisa ci kka kälpāmm\nmā ṣ nai ñake āyorsa plāc aksastä\nwalo weṣṣäṃ lariya yaṣṣūcaṃts ekalymi nesau\nkrᵤi ṅke cai täṅwaṃñeñ-cä otä ṅke ñiś ysape ykāk källātä",
        "title": "THT 78",
        "words": [
